Z||000003||rogergarrison||03-27-2001||03:54 PM||||in Ohio, you have to have vehicle inspected by Hiway Patrol, then they give you an approval slip to take to DMV. You have to have VIN # and sales reciepts for all the parts that normally are marked with VIN, or the HP will not give you an approval.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Black88GT||03-27-2001||06:00 PM||||Thats how it is in MD.  You have to go to the State police barracks first.||||reg||1
Z||000005||terryk||03-28-2001||01:18 AM||||In CA, there is Salvage and Junk. Either way, you get it safety inspected and then the DMV issues the title (depending on which one applies).||||reg||1
